2026-11-06T03:17:35.9087849Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-06T03:17:35.9088422Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-06T03:17:35.9088907Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-06T03:17:35.9089348Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-06T03:17:35.9089792Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-06T03:17:35.9090646Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-06T03:17:35.9091168Z    /root
2026-11-06T03:17:35.9096106Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-06T03:17:35.9097097Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-06T03:17:35.9106422Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-06T03:17:35.9107358Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-06T03:17:35.9107865Z 
2026-11-06T03:17:35.9108452Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
